  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by Takko Fashion Polska Sp. z o.o., from Store 3449 in Wrocław, Poland. The header includes the company name, registered address, store number, telephone number, tax identification number (NIP), BDO registration number, cash register number, seller identifier, and receipt reference. The receipt contains a retail sales section with discount entries and concludes with a financial summary showing Total Discounts (Suma Opustu), Taxable Sales (Sprzedaż opod. PTU A), VAT Amount (23%), Total VAT (Suma PTU), and the Grand Total (SUM PLN). It also documents the payment method (EFT Card), payment confirmation, article count, cashier name, return policy, company website, store and register identifiers, transaction date and time, and a barcode, representing a standard apparel retail POS receipt used in Poland.",
